# Env / secrets
.env
*.env
!.env.sample
.env.local
.env.*.local
# Backups written by scripts/jellyfin-admin-password.py and setup-style tooling:
# a copy of .env is still a copy of the secrets, and must never be committed.
.env.bak
*.env.bak
# Env snapshots (pre-migration backups, .env.bak-<ts>, …) — these hold live
# credentials. Never tracked: one leaked here (see the 2026-09-15 cleanup).
.env.pre-*
.env.*.bak

